#: ../../language/error_codes/E4227.md:1
msgid "E4227"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4227.md:3
msgid "Compiler diagnostic name: `cancel_not_allowed_in_context`."
msgstr "コンパイラ診断名：`cancel_not_allowed_in_context`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4227.md:5
msgid ""
"A cancellable async function is called from an async context declared with "
"`nocancel`."
msgstr ""
"`nocancel` と宣言された非同期コンテキストから、キャンセル可能な非同期関数を呼"
"び出しています。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4227.md:8
msgid ""
"`nocancel` promises that cancellation cannot be introduced by the function. "
"Such a function may call synchronous functions and other `nocancel` async "
"functions, but not cancellable async functions."
msgstr ""
"`nocancel` は、その関数がキャンセルを発生させないことを保証します。このような"
"関数は同期関数と他の `nocancel` 非同期関数を呼び出せますが、キャンセル可能な"
"非同期関数は呼び出せません。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4227.md:12
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "誤った例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4227.md:14
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"async fn cancellable_operation() -> Unit {\n"
"  ()\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub async fn run_without_cancellation() -> Unit nocancel {\n"
"  cancellable_operation()\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4227.md:18
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "提案"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4227.md:20
msgid ""
"Remove `nocancel` from the caller when it needs to perform a cancellable "
"operation. If the callee genuinely cannot be cancelled, declare the callee "
"with `nocancel` as well."
msgstr ""
"呼び出し元でキャンセル可能な操作が必要な場合は、`nocancel` を外してください。"
"呼び出し先が実際にキャンセルされない場合は、呼び出し先にも `nocancel` を宣言"
"します。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E4227.md:24
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"async fn noncancellable_operation() -> Unit nocancel {\n"
"  ()\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"///|\n"
"pub async fn run_without_cancellation() -> Unit nocancel {\n"
"  noncancellable_operation()\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
